sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: The CSMS supports retrieving / deleting CustomerInformation - CustomerIdentifier

    CSMS->>CS: CustomerInformationRequest (report = true, clear = true, customerIdentifier = "OpenChargeAlliance")
    Note over CSMS: Validation: report true<br>clear true<br>customerIdentifier "OpenChargeAlliance"<br>idToken is omitted<br>customerCertificate is omitted
    CS-->>CSMS: CustomerInformationResponse (status = Accepted)
    CS->>CSMS: NotifyCustomerInformationRequest
    CSMS-->>CS: NotifyCustomerInformationResponse
